t-amber-400 mb-4 font-medium tracking-wide\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><a class=\"hover:underline transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Home</a><span>&gt;</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><a class=\"hover:underline transition-colors\" href=\"/digital-library\">Digital Library</a></div></nav><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><span class=\"w-6 h-0.5 bg-amber-400\"></span><span class=\"text-amber-400 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase\">KNOWLEDGE RESOURCES</span></div><h1 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-serif font-light text-white leading-tight max-w-3xl mb-4 drop-shadow-sm\">A digital hub for Qur&#x27;anic studies and scholarly resources.</h1><p class=\"text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-2xl font-light mb-8 drop-shadow-sm\">A searchable collection of tafsir, Qur&#x27;anic sciences, classical books, manuscripts, journals, audio, and video resources—all in one place.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\"><a href=\"#categories\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-600 text-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full transition shadow-lg\"><span>Browse Digital Library</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"#all-resources\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white border border-white/30 backdrop-blur-sm text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full transition shadow-sm\"><span>Search all resources</span></a></div></div></section></div><section class=\"py-12 bg-slate-100/70 border-b border-slate-200/80 my-6\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-center\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\"><span class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-serif text-slate-700 font-light mb-2\">12</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-500 tracking-widest uppercase\">DIGITAL LIBRARY CATEGORIES</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\"><span class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-serif text-slate-700 font-light mb-2\">20</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-500 tracking-widest uppercase\">RESOURCES</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\"><span class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-serif text-slate-700 font-light mb-2\">4</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-500 tracking-widest uppercase\">PUBLICATION LANGUAGES</span></div></div></section><section id=\"categories\" class=\"py-16 md:py-20 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6\"><div class=\"mb-10\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"w-6 h-0.5 bg-amber-600\"></span><span class=\"text-amber-700 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase\">CATEGORIES</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-3\">Explore Digital Library</h2><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm max-w-2xl leading-relaxed\">Every category below is dynamic. New categories added in the admin panel appear here, in navigation, in search and in filters automatically.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition-shadow flex flex-col justify-between group\"><div><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-amber-700 mb-3 block\">RESOURCES</span><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-serif text-slate-800 font-medium group-hover:text-emerald-800 transition-colors\">Tafsir Collections</h3><span class=\"text-sm font-serif text-slate-500 font-normal dir-rtl ml-2 shrink-0\">مجموعات التفسير</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6\">Classical and contemporary commentaries of the Holy Qur&#x27;an, indexed by school, era and methodology.</p></div><div><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-emerald-800 hover:text-emerald-700 text-xs font-medium transition-colors\" href=\"/digital-library/tafsir\"><span>3 Resources</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition-shadow flex flex-col justify-between group\"><div><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-amber-700 mb-3 block\">RESOURCES</span><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-serif text-slate-800 font-medium group-hover:text-emerald-800 transition-colors\">Qur&#x27;anic Sciences</h3><span class=\"text-sm font-serif text-slate-500 font-normal dir-rtl ml-2 shrink-0\">علوم القرآن</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6\">Foundational disciplines: asbab al-nuzul, nasikh wa mansukh, i&#x27;jaz, qira&#x27;at and rasm al-mushaf.</p></div><div><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-emerald-800 hover:text-emerald-700 text-xs font-medium transition-colors\" href=\"/digital-library/quranic-sciences\"><span>2 Resources</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition-shadow flex flex-col justify-between group\"><div><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-amber-700 mb-3 block\">RESOURCES</span><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-serif text-slate-800 font-medium group-hover:text-emerald-800 transition-colors\">Classical Islamic Books</h3><span class=\"text-sm font-serif text-slate-500 font-normal dir-rtl ml-2 shrink-0\">الكتب الإسلامية الكلاسيكية</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6\">Heritage texts in fiqh, hadith, aqidah, usul and Arabic grammar.</p></div><div><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-emerald-800 hover:text-emerald-700 text-xs font-medium transition-colors\" href=\"/digital-library/classical-books\"><span>2 Resources</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition-shadow flex flex-col justify-between group\"><div><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-amber-700 mb-3 block\">RESOURCES</span><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-serif text-slate-800 font-medium group-hover:text-emerald-800 transition-colors\">Digital Manuscripts</h3><span class=\"text-sm font-serif text-slate-500 font-normal dir-rtl ml-2 shrink-0\">المخطوطات الرقمية</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6\">High-resolution facsimiles of rare Qur&#x27;anic and Islamic manuscripts with codicological records.</p></div><div><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-emerald-800 hover:text-emerald-700 text-xs font-medium transition-colors\" href=\"/digital-library/manuscripts\"><span>2 Resources</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition-shadow flex flex-col justify-between group\"><div><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-amber-700 mb-3 block\">RESOURCES</span><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-serif text-slate-800 font-medium group-hover:text-emerald-800 transition-colors\">Research Papers</h3><span class=\"text-sm font-serif text-slate-500 font-normal dir-rtl ml-2 shrink-0\">الأوراق البحثية</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6\">Peer-reviewed papers produced by Institute researchers and international fellows.</p></div><div><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-emerald-800 hover:text-emerald-700 text-xs font-medium transition-colors\" href=\"/digital-library/research-papers\"><span>2 Resources</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition-shadow flex flex-col justify-between group\"><div><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-amber-700 mb-3 block\">RESOURCES</span><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-serif text-slate-800 font-medium group-hover:text-emerald-800 transition-colors\">E Books</h3><span class=\"text-sm font-serif text-slate-500 font-normal dir-rtl ml-2 shrink-0\">الكتب الإلكترونية</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6\">Institute e-book editions optimised for reading on tablets and e-readers.</p></div><div><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-emerald-800 hover:text-emerald-700 text-xs font-medium transition-colors\" href=\"/digital-library/ebooks\"><span>1 Resource</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition-shadow flex flex-col justify-between group\"><div><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-amber-700 mb-3 block\">RESOURCES</span><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-serif text-slate-800 font-medium group-hover:text-emerald-800 transition-colors\">Academic Journals</h3><span class=\"text-sm font-serif text-slate-500 font-normal dir-rtl ml-2 shrink-0\">المجلات الأكاديمية</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6\">Institute journals with complete issue archives and article-level metadata.</p></div><div><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-emerald-800 hover:text-emerald-700 text-xs font-medium transition-colors\" href=\"/digital-library/journals\"><span>2 Resources</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition-shadow flex flex-col justify-between group\"><div><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-amber-700 mb-3 block\">RESOURCES</span><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-serif text-slate-800 font-medium group-hover:text-emerald-800 transition-colors\">Conference Proceedings</h3><span class=\"text-sm font-serif text-slate-500 font-normal dir-rtl ml-2 shrink-0\">أعمال المؤتمرات</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6\">Full proceedings, abstract books and presentation decks from Institute conferences.</p></div><div><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-emerald-800 hover:text-emerald-700 text-xs font-medium transition-colors\" href=\"/digital-library/proceedings\"><span>1 Resource</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition-shadow flex flex-col justify-between group\"><div><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-amber-700 mb-3 block\">RESOURCES</span><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-serif text-slate-800 font-medium group-hover:text-emerald-800 transition-colors\">Audio Library</h3><span class=\"text-sm font-serif text-slate-500 font-normal dir-rtl ml-2 shrink-0\">المكتبة الصوتية</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6\">Lectures, recitations, seminars and scholarly interviews.</p></div><div><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-emerald-800 hover:text-emerald-700 text-xs font-medium transition-colors\" href=\"/digital-library/audio\"><span>2 Resources</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 md:py-20 bg-[#1e2a24] text-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6\"><div class=\"mb-10\"><span class=\"text-amber-400 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase block mb-2\">FEATURED</span><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif text-white font-light\">Highlighted from Digital Library</h2></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"border border-emerald-800/60 rounded-2xl p-6 bg-emerald-950/30 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-amber-400/50 transition-colors\"><div><span class=\"text-amber-400 text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase block mb-3\">TAFSIR COLLECTIONS</span><h3 class=\"text-lg font-serif text-white mb-3 leading-snug\">Jami&#x27; al-Bayan: A Critical Reading</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-emerald-100/70 leading-relaxed mb-6\">An annotated study of al-Tabari&#x27;s methodology in narration-based exegesis with comparative notes.</p></div><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 text-xs font-medium transition-colors\" href=\"/digital-library/resource/1\"><span>View resource</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"border border-emerald-800/60 rounded-2xl p-6 bg-emerald-950/30 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-amber-400/50 transition-colors\"><div><span class=\"text-amber-400 text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase block mb-3\">QUR&#x27;ANIC SCIENCES</span><h3 class=\"text-lg font-serif text-white mb-3 leading-snug\">Introduction to Ulum al-Qur&#x27;an</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-emerald-100/70 leading-relaxed mb-6\">Graduate-level primer surveying the classical sciences of the Qur&#x27;an with contemporary readings.</p></div><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 text-xs font-medium transition-colors\" href=\"/digital-library/resource/2\"><span>View resource</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"border border-emerald-800/60 rounded-2xl p-6 bg-emerald-950/30 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-amber-400/50 transition-colors\"><div><span class=\"text-amber-400 text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase block mb-3\">DIGITAL MANUSCRIPTS</span><h3 class=\"text-lg font-serif text-white mb-3 leading-snug\">Kufic Mushaf Folio, 3rd Century AH</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-emerald-100/70 leading-relaxed mb-6\">Facsimile of an early Kufic folio with palaeographic description and provenance notes.</p></div><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 text-xs font-medium transition-colors\" href=\"/digital-library/resource/3\"><span>View resource</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section id=\"all-resources\" class=\"py-16 md:py-24 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6\"><div class=\"mb-8\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"w-6 h-0.5 bg-amber-600\"></span><span class=\"text-amber-700 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase\">SEARCH &amp; FILTER</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-3\">All resources</h2><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm max-w-2xl leading-relaxed\">Search, filter by publication state and language, and open any entry to see its media, documents and citation data.</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#f5f2eb] rounded-2xl p-3 md:p-4 mb-8 border border-amber-200/60 flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-4 items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"relative w-full lg:w-96\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 absolute left-3.5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21 21-4.34-4.34\"></path><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle></svg><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Search resources, authors and keywords\" class=\"w-full bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-full pl-10 pr-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-700/40\" value=\"\"/></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 w-full lg:w-auto text-xs\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"